# Pairs with NoStaleAuthority. The grace may end early only once every silo
# membership does not report dead has leased from the new activation; the
# mutant releases it while a silo still holds a lease from the old one.
MODULE: ReleaseGraceEarly
TARGET: NoStaleAuthority
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the grace is released before every live silo has leased afresh
PERTURBS: ReleaseGrace
BOUNDS: MaxRestarts = 1

--- FIND
    /\ \A t \in Silos : ~awaiting[t] /\ (alive[t] => lease[t] \in {"live", "margin"})
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the release check is dropped.
    /\ TRUE
--- END
